      "title": "冒险试一个旧熟茶",
      "content": "<div data-v-30fd709a=\"\" class=\"richtext-item\"><span data-v-b18ab2be=\"\" data-v-30fd709a=\"\" class=\"pb-text-wrapper\" index=\"0\" content=\"[object Object]\" fid=\"194008\" tid=\"10747987366\" order-id=\"0\"><span data-v-b18ab2be=\"\">这么密集的黄斑，跟金花不太一样。这是一个08年熟茶，昨天刚收到。一个老朋友压成了巨型沱茶，拆下来的，一直存在临沧。这个黄斑未明物质，冲泡后有小颗粒浮在茶汤表面上。洗了两泡。感觉这茶汤的茶味很淡，茶汤有点米汤的感觉，喝了3-4泡不敢喝了</span></span></div><div data-v-30fd709a=\"\" class=\"richtext-item\"><div data-v-5743628b=\"\" data-v-30fd709a=\"\" class=\"image-card-wrapper\" index=\"1\" content=\"[object Object]\" fid=\"194008\" tid=\"10747987366\" order-id=\"0\" is-last=\"true\"><div data-v-5743628b=\"\" class=\"image-list-wrapper\"><div data-v-5c6b1359=\"\" data-v-5743628b=\"\" class=\"image-list-item lazy-img-wrapper tbfe-1px-border cursor-pointer\" style=\"--padding-bottom: 1; --image-ratio: 1;\"><figure style=\"margin:12px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"/uploads/collected/4d373fd45e47e2ce.jpg\" alt=\"\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px\" /></figure><!----><!----><!----></div><div data-v-5c6b1359=\"\" data-v-5743628b=\"\" class=\"image-list-item lazy-img-wrapper tbfe-1px-border cursor-pointer\" style=\"--padding-bottom: 1; --image-ratio: 1;\"><figure style=\"margin:12px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://tiebapic.baidu.com/forum/pic/item/46a40db30f2442a7bc69aca59743ad4bd0130244.jpg?tbpicau=2026-06-14-05_efd13d1cb5a0e5b2491723ec179fecd9\" alt=\"\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px\" /></figure><!----><!----><!----></div><div data-v-5c6b1359=\"\" data-v-5743628b=\"\" class=\"image-list-item lazy-img-wrapper tbfe-1px-border cursor-pointer\" style=\"--padding-bottom: 1; --image-ratio: 1;\"><figure style=\"margin:12px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"/uploads/collected/d0ba964c7e2b288b.jpg\" alt=\"\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px\" /></figure><!----><!----><!----></div><div data-v-5c6b1359=\"\" data-v-5743628b=\"\" class=\"image-list-item lazy-img-wrapper tbfe-1px-border cursor-pointer\" styl